# vvaharness/rules/repo_kinds.py

Deterministic repository-kind classifier for Stage 2 (threat model), plus the two lookup tables Stage 2 feeds into its prompt: the STRIDE letters to consider per entry-point kind, and the per-kind baseline threat checklist whose stable `BL-...` ids let the code check the model's disposition of each item.

